  "details": "Hi all,\nI'm running into a bug while trying to write a generic, resuable timer. The issue I'm coming across is when I want to reset the timer. Ie, if I want it repeat every x seconds. When I copy the variable `max_time` to `time_left` it appears to do nothing.\nIn the screenshot I have a debug log printing the value of `time_left`. The expected output is 10, which is the value of `max_time` but instead the output shows it's keeping its original value even though it should be set directly before.",
